# PF-07 raw Gaia/Hipparcos dataset pipeline (source material for public/assets/ and
# src/data/celestial/*.js, which are the converted/committed runtime binaries - see
# docs/delivery-plan/PF-07-space-portfolio-webgl.md §1). Not needed to build or run the site.
gaia_datasets/

# PF-07 prototype source (the DC-template original this feature was ported from - reference
# material only, not a build/runtime dependency; see docs/delivery-plan/PF-07-space-portfolio-webgl.md
# §1). Was accidentally committed once (42MB, since stripped from history) - kept gitignored so a
# plain `git add -A`/`git add .` can never pull it back in.
Interactive Outerspace Portfolio/

# PF-07 ship-v2 source asset downloads (Sketchfab originals, ~255MB: raw GLB/glTF/USDZ +
# 4K texture exports). Conversion input for scripts/build-craft-assets.mjs, which produces
# the committed runtime GLBs in public/assets/craft/. Never commit the originals.
resources/
